      "name": "Search book",
      "description": "Customer benefit: Easy way to find a desired book.\nBusiness benefit: \n1) Track what our customers are interested in. Gather analytics. \n2) Drive revenue.\nAcceptance criteria:\n1) Free text search box, to search by title, author, description, gander, fuzzy search.\n2) Search criteria/filters: price, year of publication, reviews, title, author, description, best seller\n3) view book details: image, description, price,  title, author.\n4) sorting\n5) \"out of store\" notification (user friendly to encourage to come back) + subscribe to get notified when book is back to store.\n6) Store all the search words entered by the customers. \n7) NFRs: Search shall not take more than 3secs; Lazy load with most relevant results on top; no injections (Security); response design for mobile devices;  accessible design.",
